    "body": "Merged main to resolve conflicts (crates/app/src/operation/types/mod.rs: kept main's sinker re-export plus this PR's DEFAULT_CLEARANCE; crates/app/tests/wire_post.rs: kept both sides' tests, GOLDEN follows main's wire_slug_punch.nc; two struct-literal fixes for the new stock/clearance fields in tests/posted_gates/wire.rs and tests/wire_readers.rs, separate commit). Targeted gate: app wire_post 8, wire_contour 8, wire_verify 3, wire_readers 7, golden_cl 27, solid_law_goldens 6; motion wire_edm 8; sim wire 6; all pass; clippy -D warnings clean on motion/sim/app/ui. PR was ready and was turned back into a draft. Needs a review of the new head before merge.",
